*==========================================================
*basic setup: VGOS-OPS
*==========================================================

dr_win -5.e-6  5.e-6
sb_win -2.0 2.0

pc_mode multitone
pc_period 1
ion_smooth true
mbd_anchor sbd
samplers 4 abcdefgh ijklmnop qrstuvwx yzABCDEF
ref_freq 10680.4
weak_channel 0.1
pc_amp_hcode 0.001

* general ionosphere search parameters:
ion_npts 75
ion_win  -100.0 100.0
